│ generalised seizure types (absence, myoclonus).cochranelibrary.com"}, {"study_index": 38, "title": "Multiple         │
│ treatment comparisons in epilepsy monotherapy trials", "abstract": "The choice of antiepileptic drug for an          │
│ individual should be based upon the highest quality evidence regarding potential benefits and harms of the available │
│ treatments. Systematic reviews and meta-analysis of randomised controlled trials should be a major source of         │
